{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_title", "source_sha256": "86eccdd39692d13efb2055cb2e5278096a2e41d74bcea129b8abc5f6b870d6a8", "ja": "それは何の変哲もない", "zh": "那只是平平无奇的", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ac91ef3597815a8f68fb968f7816c0a79f7fce0a2c9b851e771187c693a9d5d8", "ja": "公演前、ソワソワしている麗花。もしや彼氏\nができた？と心配するメンバー。だが麗花と\n待ち合わせをしていたのは小さな男の子だっ\nた。麗花は公演で、男の子や来てくれた人達\nみんなを、笑顔にしたいと願う。", "zh": "公演前，丽花显得有些坐立不安。大家不禁\n担心她是不是交了男朋友？然而与丽花碰面\n的却是一个小男孩。丽花希望能在公演中，\n让那个男孩以及所有到场的观众都绽放笑颜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a6863424ee4941b92cbea0b5772d9e220c85b348f0b7f66e5c56edcc5ad119f0", "ja": "（麗花のセンター公演は、満員御礼で終わった）", "zh": "（丽花的中心公演在满场观众的喝彩声中圆满结束了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1001_p", "source_sha256": "42272988b5f0a9501ada03214227682be49386c443c34999757058a7339c3598", "ja": "（鳴り止まない拍手に迎えられ、麗花達が再び、\nアンコールに応えるためにステージへと姿を現す）", "zh": "（伴随着经久不息的掌声，丽花她们再次登上舞台，回应安可呼声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "d22406c763c6e44860d4fd8c554758fc0f0a142db275593ba5a0b7d52b4da0c3", "ja": "会場のみんなー！　私の新曲、どうでしたかー！？", "zh": "现场的大家——！觉得我的新歌怎么样——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1003_audience", "source_sha256": "87c4d5d13913a76f079ebb73eb3f74880f9a67833353a64b899a2cd4dab8a878", "ja": "ワアアアアア！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "b0371e6d9bd7008b2f83cc23e8e8dbf49a22056302a0ceabca73895ca427a491", "ja": "わーい、ありがとうございます♪\nみんなの笑顔、とってもまぶしくて嬉しいな♪", "zh": "哇——谢谢大家♪\n大家的笑容真的好耀眼，太开心啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "40337e8219df4b9ab2c06d31a7757638a1e83c83beee820378a8e8b4c9e7d1ed", "ja": "『空に手が触れる場所』、とっても\n素敵な曲ですよね？　私も大好きです！", "zh": "《触碰天空的地方》，真的是一首\n非常棒的歌曲呢？我也最喜欢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "67291f3dc05e9155eb39fec1bdf363243fc55a49d44d7fce535a235a9a7fd82c", "ja": "山で「ヤッホー！」って叫ぶ時と同じように、\n私の歌も、遠くまで届けようと思って歌いました。", "zh": "就像在山里大喊“呀吼——！”时那样，\n我也想着要把自己的歌声传到远方，于是就唱了出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "5335a2411468355766fb5dc4937da2d6a6c1872f8bcc91b8d1a86d062fdf6b4c", "ja": "今日は本当に、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "今天真的很谢谢大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1008_audience", "source_sha256": "87c4d5d13913a76f079ebb73eb3f74880f9a67833353a64b899a2cd4dab8a878", "ja": "ワアアアアア！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "c5c23fc63b71454c570c6222a5a12ad5d7b48e7a07f97abca387a3725fbab949", "ja": "えっと、ケンジ君は……。", "zh": "那个，健司他……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1010_p", "source_sha256": "813899d57be3548c6870479b70a07352c69b349f4f942c8d1e1347867e656e79", "ja": "あ、いたいた。\nおーい、麗花。こっちだぞ！", "zh": "啊，找到了找到了。\n喂——丽花，这边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "c68a7d02376bdefa7928f4c73ffaf0a97a1da9b89cc7fade43d6060562b4727b", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nケンジ君も！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n健二也在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1012_kenji", "source_sha256": "fe316dbb0b0167ddd7bba10581b3a938010b188b9f55b54ba3ee59fe182b7ffc", "ja": "麗花お姉ちゃん……。", "zh": "丽花姐姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "f91087c50defa15d1011cf71babad6a9c3877477fa01c46c8e4501d11d90ad59", "ja": "公演、観に来てくれてありがとう！\nライブ、楽しかった？", "zh": "谢谢你来看演出！\n现场演出开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1014_kenji", "source_sha256": "a794c2be13adfab7dda83d725f925128a7523dd46e0f98fd423296c110294beb", "ja": "うん。\nえっと……。", "zh": "嗯。\n那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1016_kenji", "source_sha256": "488994dbe926aa09cd03aa7273727951abf7efb90c9219fbf718569e4127ba08", "ja": "……やっぱり、なんでもない。\n招待してくれてありがとう。", "zh": "……果然，没什么。\n谢谢你的邀请。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1017_kenji", "source_sha256": "620e9a6a07723ad4fe6fe987f9876e3eb533907e3a75235a31ff63f77a4055c9", "ja": "……じゃあね、バイバイ。", "zh": "……那先这样，拜拜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "f336e5b44b96d30bf7978254da275b026810ddc7ab7aec8dd4b29e7c6379383e", "ja": "え？　あ、うん！\nばいばーい！　気を付けて帰ってね！", "zh": "诶？啊，嗯！\n拜拜——！回去路上小心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "30145763c5610348f3090efb201be9661702c72b2c6b400d381233a539f4895a", "ja": "レイ！\n……あれ？　ケンジのやつ、もう帰っちまったのか。", "zh": "丽——！\n……咦？健二那家伙，已经回去了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "a7679faa6c18d639eb692b482042df63903107e3d9372df1aa5bc88baaa5719e", "ja": "あれれ？　どうしたんだろ。今日のステージ、\nすっごく楽しかったと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "奇怪？怎么回事呢。今天的舞台，\n我觉得非常开心呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "d41e4785d26b853b72f115d2c714884999c5d575f532553be9320dc1034a2ddf", "ja": "ケンジ君……もっと、\n笑ってくれるかと思ったのにな……。", "zh": "健司……我还以为你会笑得更开心一点呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "02f85c49dacec629abf5fabc2cabcd326778fba5d0e416209cb3c1d1d50a12d9", "ja": "私、何か失敗しちゃったのかも……。", "zh": "我是不是哪里搞砸了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1025_052kao", "source_sha256": "9032d309c1942cd1edde2ad48d10934eb997242b01587d01a4b30069b527da47", "ja": "麗花ちゃん……。", "zh": "丽花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "6ff7c93f1e3e672aba130b61b37d677f4537d81335c98bb87d0065b847ac5645", "ja": "桃子、舞台袖から見てたけど。あの子、\n麗花さんの歌を聞いてる時、すごく笑顔だったよ。", "zh": "桃子在舞台侧面看到了。那孩子听丽花小姐唱歌的时候，笑得特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "c7eee5e0c4384c65e78cd1dbbf0e7b123743bf8ee527ac4e6852c9172847df2d", "ja": "きっと、うまく言えなかっただけなんだと思う。\nだから……。", "zh": "我想，她一定只是没能好好说出口。\n所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "82b42bcd2ef29a2dca415171ba6346794b70668c73ae701079ecdf00d0404839", "ja": "桃子ちゃん……。", "zh": "桃子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1029_p", "source_sha256": "bf906ce6b7b91c70601975fdf428ee648b03b5c7ee92b32f1cdca64e5ffe17d2", "ja": "そうだな。それに、もしかしたら……。", "zh": "是啊。而且，说不定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1030_p", "source_sha256": "2ff8a9d654b62a9057043ba4f7fa576d189bb03f135db362f50b24dec1b13153", "ja": "あの子は、麗花とお別れするのが、\n急に寂しくなっちゃったのかもしれないな……。", "zh": "那孩子可能是因为要和丽花分别，\n突然觉得寂寞了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_104_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "4ceba0d879ea70d17f45d8bb558c822ad19e7d4a2b0d912a03dc956138ec7996", "ja": "……そっか。\n寂しい、かぁ……。", "zh": "……这样啊。\n觉得寂寞，吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
